# Address of the deployed Fluff contract on the GenLayer Studio network.
# Vite inlines VITE_* at BUILD time, so changing this needs a redeploy, not a restart.
VITE_FLUFF_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x163599354067123EFACa92EdA79E667A7CD6079d

# Informational. src/lib/chain/network.ts is authoritative for the network, so the
# client cannot end up on the wrong chain because of a stale value here.
VITE_GENLAYER_NETWORK=studionet
VITE_GENLAYER_CHAIN_ID=61999
